  <item>
    <title>Vol.1 与翠爷真诚对话：如何经营好一家贝果店</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/635de4fdb55c9cee2ee156bd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">635de4fdb55c9cee2ee156bd</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 30 Oct 2022 07:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>贝果起源于17世纪的维也纳，当地的一位犹太面包师傅，为了表达对波兰皇从土耳其的入侵中解救奥地利的敬意，特别用经过酵母发酵的面团，做出了马蹬形的圈饼。后来，这枚小小的面包圈居然在美国纽约得以大火。现在，上海大街小巷的咖啡馆面包店也不乏贝果的影子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为一个面包星人，主播Abi最爱的还是这家建国西路上的小店——翠贝果。今天就让我们对话主理人翠爷，一起听他聊聊贝果店经营史！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Foady7m3KDcdA43NBmeKQPMUd72K.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>|时间轴|</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a>初识翠爷 - 什么样的店老板竟活跃得像个营销号？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="354">05:54</a>贝果的历史：犹太血统且爱组CP</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a>贝果的制作：无油无糖，健康美味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="806">13:26</a>在翠爷成为翠爷之前：满怀一腔热血，证券师转行做甜品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1074">17:54</a>餐饮死亡谷：从开业到能够生存要经历一段低谷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1163">19:23</a>为了生存，增加SKU，贝果上架: "情怀在商业面前一文不值”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a>什么促成了转变？如何痛下决心？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1394">23:14</a>餐饮界前辈的6字真言和4字窍诀——“低价、广谱、高频”和“一干一湿”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1622">27:02</a>新店开业以及至暗四五月：有无奈也有意料之外的幸运</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1935">32:15</a>产品SKU要少，但是铺设渠道/纬度要多，提升人效频效</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2087">34:47</a>个人品牌的建立：恬咖啡为何改名成翠贝果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2323">38:43</a>餐饮品牌三段论：牌子-品牌-名牌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2385">39:45</a>餐饮前辈给新晋餐饮人的建议（万万没想到...)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgZnHu6uFtfGozGtcjpD37CRCrX7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>|翠爷的贝果店|</span></p><span></span><p><span>店名：翠贝果</span></p><span></span><p><span>地址：乌鲁木齐南路205号1F-01室</span></p><span></span><p><span>新店：陕西北路408号-3室</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrOum0aaI0a2djmE4ENVsymqd477.m4a" length="45530370" type="audio/mp4"/>
